        "title": "Ai lung bammei paeng thang ram gaimei nai",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Ai lung bammei paeng thang ram gaimei nai,",
            "Khou tei gut khang nkhuan liat lak;",
            "Nthanmei nun bampui ram e,",
            "Ai hou nina nkhuan bam e.",
            "",
            "He! Taek maknga nzuan tat dikho,",
            "Pou Jisu zan khou rui.",
            "",
            "2. Hei ramgai thang tei nzuan tat dikho,",
            "Taek makna nzuan tat dikho;",
            "Lunghkiang lou pui bam khang makge,",
            "Poubaomei bam guang tangh maksan.",
            "",
            "3. Hei ram gaimei tei ai ningtaan makge,",
            "Rih pingpui bam khou bamsini;",
            "Tingkauh ram guang tangpui nungmu,",
            "Neihla mei hei kimdat lak khe.",
            "",
            "4. He! Tingkao Bumaeng Thanmei guang datro",
            "Lungh zinghmei tigaan lou datro;",
            "Nang ram gaimei thang duangh lou o,",
            "Tingsaeng mban thaipui ram khou."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
